    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlūgū na Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi adatū, ūbasuga a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè n'ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūsolanhya banhū shihūmbī shidatū ū mu Baisilaeli, abo shihūmbī shibīlī wikala nabo wei īpandī lya Mikimashi, na mu sī ya magūlya ga Beeseli; abo shihūmbī shimò būbiza na Yonasani ipandī lya Gibea ya mu sī ya Benjamini, a banhū a bangī ūbawīla kūshoka kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūūkadumīla ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti yalī Geba wīkenaagūla; a Bafilisiti būgwigwa ū mhayo gwenūyo. Hūna ū Saulo ūfuula mhembe kūlwa kūkumūcha hose pyī ū mu sī; ūhaya, “Igwaagi pye a Bahebulania.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana pye a Baisilaeli būjiigwa ī ng'hūlū jenījo; ī gīkī ū Saulo wakenaagūlaga ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti, nī gīkī a Baisileli bakanung'ha inyema ū kū Bafilisiti. A banhū bikobya kūnondeela Saulo, būūkibilingīla Giligaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti nabo bibilinga bingī no kūlwa kwilwisha būlūgū na a Baisilaeli; baalī na magogoteni ga būlūgū shihūmbī shidatū, na bendeesha baago shihūmbī shitandatū, a bashilikale a bene baalī bingī no, gītī maseni ga ha ng'walo gwa nyanza. Būūkatūūla ī ng'hambī yabo Mikimashi, kīya ya Beeti-aveni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho babona gīkī ī mihayo īkūbadaamīla (nguno bakogoha, būgwa ng'holò), būja kwibisa mu mahalo na mu masaka, mu mapilinga ga mawe, mu myoobo na mu makomelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikomelo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ichongo itaale, ishimu: Mu sī ja makoye ga minzī; makanza gamò machongo ga mbika yenīyo gakasīmbagwa, kūlwa kūlang'hana minzī ga kūng'wa mitugo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo bamò ba Bahebulania būgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, būūkibisa kū sī ja Gadi na Gileadi. Ū Saulo ūshiiga Giligaali; pye a bashilikale abo banondeelaga baadetemaga no nguno ya boobà.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūhang'wa na Sang'weli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūlindīīla ikanza lya shikū mpungatī gīt'ūmo Sang'weli walī wahelela; alīyo ū Sang'weli atizile ī Giligaali, nose a banhū bakwe ū Saulo bandya kūsambaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūhaya, “Ī gete nenhelagi aha ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa nī shakwinha sha būsangī.” Ū Saulo ūshifunya ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala dūhū ū kūshifunya ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa, ū Sang'weli ūshika; ū Saulo ūja kūnsūng'wanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūmūūja, “Bebe wītaga mhayo kī ū gwenūyū?” Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Aho naabona gīkī a banhū bandya kūsambaala alīyo nū bebe ūtizaga gīt'ūmo twalī twalaganīla, hama nūūbabona na a Bafilisiti bakwikumingaga Mikimashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūbona gīkī, ‘Ī gete nose a Bafilisiti bakūkīla bize ī Giligaali, banisange nataalī nūūlū kūlomba būgunanhi bo ng'wa SEEBA.’ Na lūūlū nihadīkīja ū kūfunya ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Wītaga mhayo gwa nyachilū ū gwenūyo, ūtashidiimile ī shilagīlo īsho SEEBA Mulungu wako walī wakwinhile; ūlū ni washidima, ī haha ū SEEBA ni wabūguzuhya ū būtemi wako; ni wakwīta ūbize ntemi wa Baisilaeli wa būja na būja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha ū būtemi wako būtūūsegenela, ū SEEBA wamalaga kūkooba munhū ūngī ūyo alī ha ng'holò yakwe; ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo wansolaga kūbiza ntongeeji wa banhū bakwe, nguno ū bebe ūtashidiimile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Sang'weli ūbūūka wīnga ī Giligaali ūja Gibea ya Benjamini, ū Saulo ūbiisaaba a banhū abo walī nabo būbiza magana atandatū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kūgayiwa Shilanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani hamò na a banhū abo bakashiigīīla, bakikala Gibea ya Benjamini; a Bafilisiti a bene būtūūla ī ng'hambī yabo Mikimashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti būtūma mabità adatū ga banhū ba kūja bakūdimaga shikolo īsho shalekilwe kūlwa kūpeela būlūgū; ibità līmò lyūlola Ofula mapandī ga Shuali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līngī lyūlola Beeti-holoni, ī lya kadatū lyūjīlīīla kū lūbīmbī lwa kwipandī lyalī lilolile na ntubīlo gwa Zeboimu bbihī na kwitogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo baalī batīho basuji ba shikolo sha chūma pye a hose ū mu sī ya Baisilaeli, nguno a Bafilisiti baahayaga, “Nose a Bahebulania bakūyūbeeja na shū nūūlū machimu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū pye a Baisilaeli bajaga kū Bafilisiti baakabeegejiwa kwenūko a magembe gabo nī sūlūlū, nī mbasa nī mihoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūbeegejiwa igembe nūūlū sūlūlū baalīpaga gulamu inaane ja shekeeli, ū kūbeegejiwa lūgoko lwa chūma nī mbasa nū kūnoolelwa ī someke baafunyaga gulamu inè ja shekeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū mu shikū ja būlūgū, a bashilikale abo baalī hamò na Saulo nū Yonasani walī atīho nūūlū ūmò wabo ūyo walī na lūshū mu nkono nūūlū ichimu, ūlū atī Saulo dūhū na ng'witūnja wakwe Yonasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti bakatūma ibità līngī lya badīīmi ba shikolo, ī lyene lyūsola nzīla ya kūbītīla kū būkīlīlo wa Mikimashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
